{title: Seene Me Jalan}
{artist: Suresh Wadkar}
{key: F#}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#] [E] [F#]
seene mein jalan aankhon mein tufaan saa kyon hai
[F#] [E] [F#]
is shahar mein har shaks pareshaan saa kyon hai
[F#] [B] [E] [F#]
dil hai to dhadkaane ka bahaanaa koee dhoondhe
[F#] [E] [F#]
patthar kee tarah behees-o-bejaan saa kyon hai
[F#] [B] [E] [F#]
tanhaee kee ye kaunsee manzil hai rafeekon
[F#] [E] [F#],        taa-hadde-nazar ek bayaabaan saa kyun hai
[F#] [B] [E] [F#]
kyaa koee nayee baat nazar aatee hai hum me
[F#] [E] [F#]
aaeena humein dekh ke hairaan saa kyun hai
